{
  "slug": "cc",
  "name": "Cc",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-session awareness for Claude Code. See all active sessions on the same project, get file conflict warnings when two sessions touch the same file, and send messages between sessions — all automatically via hooks. Uses Claude Code's /tmp directories for instant liveness detection with zero configuration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `batch` (Run evals or prompts across hundreds of parallel Claude Code sessions), `cc` (session roster and messaging)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cc`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cc@claude-community` from `anipotts/cc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
